WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.080
I'm a career consultant working for companies and helping them understand how to grow.

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:09.720
In fact, you said you want to help your companies get to the next level.

00:00:09.720 --> 00:00:14.640
Here's my book, which talks about getting to the next level of performance.

00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:17.440
So the next level is where it is we want to go.

00:00:17.440 --> 00:00:22.600
We want to have organizations that are creative, resilient, and valuable.

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:23.760
And so that's been my focus.

00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:26.120
I started off after my MBA.

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:29.200
First of all, you and I are [unclear] State graduates.

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:30.560
I'm a chemical engineer.

00:00:30.560 --> 00:00:33.080
And then I went on to get an MBA from Columbia.

00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:36.480
And then I moved into the consulting world, trying to see if I would like it.

00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:37.600
Turns out I loved it.

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:40.600
And I stayed with it through a whole series of years.

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:44.920
And then as a final time, I was a senior partner with Deloitte Consulting.

00:00:44.920 --> 00:00:49.800
It comes up to a point where you have to move on because you get to a retirement age,

00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:53.120
which is not a bad idea because it gives uplift for the young people.

00:00:53.120 --> 00:00:55.920
So I set up a new company called Sage Partners.

00:00:55.920 --> 00:00:59.960
We have 18 partners and we're all experienced managers and…
